            <ArticleTitle>Red tattoo-related mycosis fungoides-like CD8+ pseudolymphoma.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/cup.13089</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cutaneous reactions to red tattoo pigment rarely manifest as pseudolymphomatous reactions. We describe an exceedingly rare case of red tattoo-related T-cell predominant pseudolymphoma microscopically mimicking mycosis fungoides. Careful clinicopathological correlation was required to obtain the correct diagnosis and aid in an effective treatment course.</AbstractText>
